                       '  [LoopType.TURN_TOOL_CALL_CAP]:\n'
                       "    'the turn reached the per-turn tool-call limit',\n"
                       '  [LoopType.INVALID_TOOL_PARAMS_STAGNATION]:\n'
                       "    'the model repeatedly sent invalid tool parameters without "
