                      '/**\n'
                      ' * Output ceiling for the compression generation. The request '
                      'declares no\n'
                      ' * phase budgets: the model thinks to a natural stop and then '
                      'writes the\n'
                      ' * snapshot under the pinned provider ceilings, exactly as on '
                      'an ordinary\n'
                      ' * turn, so one number covers hidden reasoning and the snapshot '
                      'together.\n'
                      ' *\n'
                      ' * It is also SUMMARY_RESERVE, the room the thresholds hold '
                      'free, which is\n'
                      ' * what keeps the budget at its full value in every state the '
                      'thresholds\n'
                      ' * admit. Sized at roughly three times the joint demand of a '
                      'reasoning pass\n'
                      ' * and a dense whole-history snapshot, because a snapshot that '
                      'stops short\n'
                      ' * costs the whole attempt while a generous ceiling costs only '
                      'working\n'
                      ' * window.\n'
                      ' */\n'
                      'export const COMPACT_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS = 49_152;\n'
                      '\n'
                      '/**\n'
                      ' * Room held back from the window when sizing the compression '
                      'generation, so\n'
                      ' * the request stays valid at any history size the send path '
                      'admits.\n'
                      ' */\n'
                      'export const COMPACTION_BUDGET_SAFETY_MARGIN = 1_024;\n'
                      '\n'
                      '/**\n'
                      ' * Output budget for one compression generation: the ceiling, '
                      'reduced to the\n'
                      ' * room the window actually leaves beside the rendered request. '
