                              'prefixItems.length`, returns\n'
                              ' *   the resolved schema from `prefixItems[index]`.\n'
                              ' * - Otherwise, if `items` is present, returns the '
                              'resolved `items` schema.\n'
                              ' * - If neither applies, returns `undefined` (no schema '
                              'constraint for this\n'
                              ' *   position — coercion should skip this element).\n'
                              ' */\n'
                              'function resolveArrayElementSchema(\n'
                              '  parentSchema: Record<string, unknown>,\n'
                              '  rootSchema: Record<string, unknown>,\n'
                              '  index: number,\n'
                              '): Record<string, unknown> | undefined {\n'
